# GitHub is the source of truth

This project lives at https://github.com/Flamini90/vogl (`origin`).

After finishing work the user asked for:

1. Commit the relevant files with a concise message that explains why.
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` if needed).
3. Do not wait for a second "please push" unless auth or a conflict blocks it.

Do not force-push to `main`/`master` unless the user explicitly asks.
